<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee firms on dollar, weakens vs pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee firms on dollar, weakens vs pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee was firmer on the dollar but weaker against the pound on Monday, commercial banks forex dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was fixed at a mean commercial rate of 20.6295 against the dollar from 20.6395 on Friday. The rupee traded at a mean rate of 32.0808 versus the pound from Friday's 32.0305.</p>
